{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ごきげんよう〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "森平麗心です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いてくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はすき焼きを食べました。\nこの時期はすき焼きがより輝いて見えます、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美味しかったです〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobGsSRzR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobjYBfyt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂スター誕生!SIXでのハロウィン仮装！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はキョンシーを着させていただきました〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "過去に先輩が着ていたのをみて凄く可愛いて着てみたかったんです〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生皆可愛いので！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひみてくださったら嬉しいです〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "( ⸝⸝⸝ᵒ̴̶̷ ꒳ ᵒ̴̶̷⸝⸝⸝)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは今日はこの辺で〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おやすみなさい〜"}], "source": "official"}